{"id":"584af21e9d08297b","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-hadamard-transform.md","title":"The n-Qubit Hadamard Transform","display":"df-hadamard-transform — The n-Qubit Hadamard Transform","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-hadamard-transform","aliases":["28-df-hadamard-transform"],"display":"df-hadamard-transform — The n-Qubit Hadamard Transform","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.3.4, equation (10.1)","source_printed_pages":"212–213","source_pdf_pages":"238–239","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-hadamard-transform"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-hadamard-transform</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hadamard-transform — The n-Qubit Hadamard Transform"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.3.4, equation (10.1)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"212–213"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"238–239"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_n=\\mathbb C^{\\Sigma^n}\">\\(\\mathcal H_n=\\mathbb C^{\\Sigma^n}\\)</span>，内积为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle v,w\\rangle=\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}\\overline{v(x)}w(x)\">\\(\\langle v,w\\rangle=\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}\\overline{v(x)}w(x)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^n\">\\(x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\cdot y=\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i y_i\\pmod2\">\\(x\\cdot y=\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i y_i\\pmod2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\oplus z\">\\(x\\oplus z\\)</span> 为逐坐标模 2 和，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{x,z}=\\mathbf1[x=z]\">\\(\\delta_{x,z}=\\mathbf1[x=z]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|x\\rangle\">\\(|x\\rangle\\)</span> 为下式定义的计算基；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_n\">\\(H_n\\)</span> 由计算基上的作用唯一线性延拓到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_n\">\\(\\mathcal H_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为该空间的恒等算子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dagger\">\\(\\dagger\\)</span> 为伴随；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_n\\in\\mathcal H_n\">\\(u_n\\in\\mathcal H_n\\)</span> 为下式给出的向量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|x\\rangle(y)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[x=y].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|x\\rangle(y)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[x=y].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_n|x\\rangle\\coloneqq2^{-n/2}\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^n}(-1)^{x\\cdot y}|y\\rangle,\\qquad u_n\\coloneqq2^{-n/2}\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^n}|y\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_n|x\\rangle\\coloneqq2^{-n/2}\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^n}(-1)^{x\\cdot y}|y\\rangle,\\qquad u_n\\coloneqq2^{-n/2}\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^n}|y\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^n}(-1)^{(x\\oplus z)\\cdot y}=2^n\\delta_{x,z},\\qquad H_n^\\dagger H_n=H_n^2=I,\\qquad H_n|0^n\\rangle=u_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^n}(-1)^{(x\\oplus z)\\cdot y}=2^n\\delta_{x,z},\\qquad H_n^\\dagger H_n=H_n^2=I,\\qquad H_n|0^n\\rangle=u_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对x≠z取一个不同坐标，将y与翻转该坐标的y配对，和式两两相消；x=z时各项为1。故矩阵列正交且H_n自伴，得到所列恒等式。n=0给一维恒等算子。补足量子算法反复复用的归一化与符号。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.3.4, equation (10.1)；印刷页 212–213；PDF 页 238–239。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第10章的 The n-Qubit Hadamard Transform，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_n=\\mathbb C^{\\Sigma^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle v,w\\rangle=\\sum_{x\\in\\Sigma^n}\\overline{v(x)}w(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in\\Sigma^n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\cdot y=\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i y_i\\pmod2","display":false},{"tex":"x\\oplus z","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{x,z}=\\mathbf1[x=z]","display":false},{"tex":"|x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"H_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_n","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\dagger","display":false},{"tex":"u_n\\in\\mathcal H_n","display":false},{"tex":"|x\\rangle(y)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1[x=y].","display":true},{"tex":"H_n|x\\rangle\\coloneqq2^{-n/2}\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^n}(-1)^{x\\cdot y}|y\\rangle,\\qquad u_n\\coloneqq2^{-n/2}\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^n}|y\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sum_{y\\in\\Sigma^n}(-1)^{(x\\oplus z)\\cdot y}=2^n\\delta_{x,z},\\qquad H_n^\\dagger H_n=H_n^2=I,\\qquad H_n|0^n\\rangle=u_n.","display":true}],"bytes":2060,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-320","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tensor-product-state]]、[[28-df-hadamard-transform]]、[[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]、[[28-lem-phase-kickback]]、[[28-df-grover-iterate]]、[[28-thm-grover-success-amplitude]]、[[28-df-simon-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-quantum-fourier-transform]]、[[28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}